sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as Pengguna / Pemilik
  participant UI as Flutter Web (Chat Panel)
  participant LLM as LLM Engine
  participant Server as Modul MCP Server
  participant Tenant as Tenant Guardrail
  participant Gateway as Module Gateway
  participant DB as MySQL Database

  User->>UI: "Berapa okupansi Gedung A saat ini?"
  UI->>LLM: Prompt + Tools Manifest
  LLM-->>UI: Invoke Tool get_building_occupancy(building_id: 1)
  
  UI->>Server: JSON-RPC Call Tool Request
  Server->>Tenant: Verify User Tenant Access (building_id: 1)
  Tenant-->>Server: Access Granted
  
  Server->>Gateway: ModuleGate::call(RoomService, getOccupancy, [1])
  Gateway->>DB: Query Aggregation Data Kamar
  DB-->>Gateway: Result (Total: 20, Terisi: 16, Rate: 80%)
  Gateway-->>Server: Formatted Metrics Data
  
  Server->>DB: Audit Log to mcp_tool_logs
  Server-->>UI: JSON-RPC Result Data Faktual
  
  UI->>LLM: Grounded Context Data
  LLM-->>UI: "Tingkat okupansi Gedung A adalah 80% (16 dari 20 kamar terisi)."
  UI-->>User: Tampilkan Jawaban Teks + Indikator Persentase
